{"name":"Shaving Cream","hex":"#e1e5e5","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"shaving cream","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A substance, usually a foam or gel, that is applied to the face or wherever else hair grows, to provide lubrication and avoid razor burn during shaving.","A type of cosmetic cream, combined with water and whipped into a lather using a shaving brush to provide lubrication and avoid razor burn during shaving."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/shaving_cream"}],"entries":[{"title":"Shaving cream","blocks":[{"text":"Shaving cream or shave cream is a category of cream cosmetics used for shaving preparation. The purpose of shaving cream is to soften the hair by providing lubrication."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/Crema_para_afeitar.JPG/330px-Crema_para_afeitar.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shaving_cream","wikidata":"Q413152"},{"title":"Shaving Cream (song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Shaving Cream\" is a song written by Benny Bell in 1946, and originally sung by Paul Wynn. It is a novelty song in which each verse ends with a mind rhyme of shit, the initial sh- transitioning into the refrain, \"Shaving Cream\"."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/1a/Shaving_Cream_%28Benny_Bell_single_-_cover_art%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shaving_Cream_(song)","wikidata":"Q7491108"},{"title":"Shaving","blocks":[{"text":"Shaving is the removal of hair, by using a razor or any other kind of bladed implement, to slice it down—to the level of the skin or otherwise. Shaving is most commonly practiced by men to remove their facial hair and by women to remove their leg and underarm hair. A man is called clean-shaven if he has had his beard entirely removed."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/64/AtTheCuttingEdge.jpg/330px-AtTheCuttingEdge.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shaving","wikidata":"Q369570"},{"title":"Cream","blocks":[{"text":"Cream is a dairy product composed of the higher-fat layer skimmed from the top of milk before homogenization. The butterfat, which is less dense, rises to the top and is skimmed off, resulting in gravity cream. The industrial production of cream instead uses centrifugal separators to make separator cream. Cream is often sold in grades defined by their butterfat content. It contains high levels of saturated fat, in ascending proportion from light cream to heavy cream."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/01_Mmm..._Apple_Crisp_with_Whipped_Cream.jpg/330px-01_Mmm..._Apple_Crisp_with_Whipped_Cream.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cream","wikidata":"Q13228"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Shaving_cream.jpg/500px-Shaving_cream.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Shaving_cream.jpg/500px-Shaving_cream.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A man using shaving cream","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AShaving_cream.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d7/A_barber_getting_ready_to_shave_the_face_of_a_seated_custome_Wellcome_V0019707.jpg/500px-A_barber_getting_ready_to_shave_the_face_of_a_seated_custome_Wellcome_V0019707.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d7/A_barber_getting_ready_to_shave_the_face_of_a_seated_custome_Wellcome_V0019707.jpg/1280px-A_barber_getting_ready_to_shave_the_face_of_a_seated_